    "Question #: 6": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-713 topic 1 question 38 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You manage the hardware and software retirement process for a customer."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The customer plans to donate several computers to a charitable organization. The computers have Windows 8 purchased as a fully-packaged product (FPP) from a local retailer. The computers also have Microsoft Office 2013 licenses that were purchased under a volume license agreement."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You have the following requirements:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Maximize license reuse."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02183/0004700001.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Ensure that license agreements are not violated."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to recommend a course of action for reusing Windows and Office licensing."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which two actions should you recommend? Each correct answer presents part of the solution."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Donate the Office licenses with the computers."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Reallocate all of the Office licenses within your organization."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Donate the Windows licenses with the computers."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Reallocate all of the Windows licenses within your organization."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: BC \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
